Autonomous-Agentic-AI Preprocessing Work flow 
---------------------------------------------

LangChain acts as the orchestrator that connects multiple agents, LLMs, tools, and memory.

It allows different agents to communicate and execute preprocessing tasks in sequence.

===================


             CSV Dataset
                  │
                  ▼
        Dataset Loader Agent
                  │
                  ▼
       Data Profiler Agent
       (Analyzes the dataset)
                  │
                  ▼
      Missing Value Agent
      (Fill or remove NULL values)
                  │
                  ▼
       Duplicate Removal Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Outlier Detection Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Data Cleaning Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Feature Engineering Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Encoding & Scaling Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Validation Agent
                  │
                  ▼
        Human Approval (Optional)
                  │
                  ▼
      Clean Dataset Ready for ML


==================

